o escaped  from like  seven different prisons and we know that  the heroes are already short on manpower  because of the two massive raids  that just took place and the many  casualties that the heroes have suffered  as a result of these raids  i mean how are the heroes supposed to  track down all for one and the league of  villains  when chaos is breaking out in the  streets escaped criminals are running  freely  all over japan and the country is still  only just beginning to recover from all  the  carnage that this war arc has created  all for one  inside of shiguraki's body then asks  spinner dobby and skeptic  to watch over him while he rests  shigaraki's body needs to rest for quite  some time  in order to be perfected however spinner  expresses concern  about this current situation he asks  this person  inside of shigaraki's body who he  actually is  in this moment after all spinner chose  to follow  tomura not all for one inside of  tomorrow's body  but all for one tells him that he has  the utmost respect for tomuna's wishes  and once tomuna's body is fully healed  then both of their desires  will be achieved but at this point we  have to be very skeptical about all for  one's claims that he is just trying to  fulfill  tomorrow's true desires after all we  already know that internally shigaraki  has been trying to get overwhelmed to  give him back his body but all for one  has refused  to do so also all for one inside of  shigaraki  is already saying things like watch over  me  while i rest so it's almost as if he is  already looking at this body  as his own it is possible that all for  one never plans to give shigaraki's body  back to him  and that he is just marinating the  league of villains so that they would  eventually come to accept that this  new shigaraki all for one inside of  shigaraki  is their true boss i'm also wondering  what all for one is planning to do with  his original body at this point  using his original body he appears to  have forced